<p class="tbkey">Paper dollars and Arena wildcards are separate currencies: a deck can be cheap in
one and expensive in the other, which is why both boards are here rather than one blended score.
<b>Hide lands</b> re-ranks both boards on the spells alone, since a mana base is the part you
build once and reuse. Sourced from the same deck costs as
<a href="https://drwu-htmls.vercel.app/mtg-creator-decks">mtg-creator-decks</a>.</p>
