<div class="footer">
  <p><strong>Method.</strong> Collection pulled live from Untapped.gg API via Chrome MCP. <b>Decks that run it</b> is counted from 55 published decklists, one point per list that names the card, whatever the quantity. Those 55 come from this project's harvest of creator videos: 219 lists that pass the Standard legality gate, narrowed to the ones whose colours sit inside the Mardu wedge (W|B|R, no U, no G). Untapped's own per-archetype lists were the other candidate source, and its <code>decks_by_event_scope_and_rank_v2</code> endpoint returns them, but each deck arrives as an opaque <code>ds</code> blob that is neither zlib, gzip, raw deflate, nor a plain varint id/quantity stream, so this page does not read them and does not claim to. Separately, the <b>Mardu-wedge archetypes</b> tile reads 17 from Untapped.gg's analytics endpoint for meta period 722 (Bronze-to-Mythic, last 30 days), filtered to colour bitmasks inside the wedge with at least 30 mythic-tier matches. That 17 is a meta-share figure and feeds no column in the ranking table.</p>
