  <p><strong>How updating could work (three options).</strong> (1) <strong>Daily auto-rebuild</strong>: a scheduled job re-pulls your collection and the live archetype table from Untapped each morning, regenerates this page, and redeploys, so it is always current with zero clicks. This is the recommended path. (2) <strong>Manual rebuild</strong>: run the pull-and-deploy command whenever you want a fresh snapshot. (3) <strong>In-page update button</strong>: a button on this page cannot fetch Untapped on its own, because the browser blocks cross-site reads to their API, so this option needs a small backend proxy and is the most work for the least gain. The deck count is bounded only by how many published lists the harvest holds.</p>
